# Tencent Video cached GDT creative rejection test - v1
# Based on 2026-09-04 腾讯2.har + 1547.log
#
# EXPERIMENT ONLY — do not merge into the stable Tencent Video rules yet.
# Purpose:
#   Verify what Tencent Video/GDT does when a cached ad object tries to load
#   its creative from pgdt.gtimg.cn and that creative request is rejected.
#
# Expected observations:
#   A) whole ad card disappears/collapses  -> downstream creative rejection may be viable
#   B) card remains but image/video is blank -> must continue upstream to GDT ad-object/cache layer
#
# Keep the existing MVL rewrite enabled.
# Do NOT clear Tencent Video cache before this test.
# Disable other Advertising.list rules so pgdt rejection is the only new variable.
#
# Rejection is intentionally host-wide for this one controlled experiment only.

^https?:\/\/pgdt\.gtimg\.cn\/.* url reject

hostname = pgdt.gtimg.cn
